Description: SecuBox ACME / TLS certificate manager
 FastAPI control plane managing the HAProxy certificate bundle at
 /data/haproxy/certs/, certbot renewals, and the WebUI surface at
 /certs/ on the canonical hub vhost. Reconstructed from the running
 deployment on gk2 (closes #306 follow-up — the module existed but
 had no source-side package).
